cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "avalia+Tec: A Tamper-Evident Platform for Integrity-Verified Academic Selection Processes"
type: software
version: 2.2.0
date-released: "2026-03-04"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ldvsantos/avalia_mais"
url: "https://github.com/ldvsantos/avalia_mais"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.18868994"
abstract: >-
  avalia+Tec is an open-source, tamper-evident platform for managing
  competitive academic selection processes (scholarships, admissions,
  faculty hiring) with cryptographic integrity verification (SHA-256,
  HMAC-SHA256), RFC 3161 trusted timestamping, hash-chained audit
  trails, and LGPD-aware data segregation.
keywords:
  - academic selection
  - tamper-evident audit trail
  - SHA-256
  - HMAC-SHA256
  - RFC 3161
  - trusted timestamping
  - LGPD
  - Node.js
